      "title": "Prospectus Summary",
      "excerpt": "PROSPECTUS SUMMARY 1 THE OFFERING 10 RISK FACTORS 12 USE OF PROCEEDS 40 CAPITALIZATION 40 MARKET INFORMATION FOR CLASS A COMMON STOCK AND DIVIDEND POLICY 41 DILUTION 42 MANAGEMENT\u2019S DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION AND RESULTS OF OPERATIONS 44 BUSINESS 67 MANAGEMENT 74 EXECUTIVE AND DIRECTOR COMPENSATION 81 CERTAIN RELATIONSHIPS AND RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS 86 PRINCIPAL SECURITYHOLDERS 87 UNDERWRITING 89 SHARES ELIGIBLE FOR FUTURE SALE 94 DESCRIPTION OF SECURITIES 95 DESCRIPTION OF THE SECURITIES WE ARE OFFERING 115 MATERIAL UNITED STATES FEDERAL INCOME TAX CONSEQUENCES 116 LEGAL MATTERS 123 EXPERTS 123 WHERE YOU CAN FIND MORE INFORMATION 124 UNAUDITED PRO FORMA CONDENSED COMBINED FINANCIAL INFORMATION 124 INDEX TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS F-1 You should rely only on the information contained in or incorporated by reference in this prospectus or in any free writing prospectus",
